    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "Hum-to-Song \u00b7 quick start",
      "pos": [
        520,
        20
      ],
      "size": [
        420,
        450
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "START HERE\n1. Upload or record 10\u201330 seconds of humming in the audio input. No recording is preselected.\n2. Edit Style and Lyrics. The sample lyrics are original placeholders.\n3. Queue. Output saves FLAC, ABC score and settings under audio/YuE2_HumToSong.\n\nDefaults: 32 steps \u00b7 dpm_2 / sgm_uniform \u00b7 CFG 1 \u00b7 hum influence 1 \u00b7 120 s maximum. The song can end earlier.\n\nThe hum adapter already includes its real-audio decoder LoRA. Do not add the old NAR adapter on top. This separate workflow leaves the instrumental workflow untouched.\n\nRequires FS Audio Suite (installed). Restart ComfyUI and refresh after installation. Models: YuE2 INT8, SheetSage2 and humsong adapter. No auto-download nodes.\n\nHum/voice input and listening quality have not been assessed with user recordings."
      ],
      "color": "#23415b",
      "bgcolor": "#1b2a3a"
    }
